          "sha256": "51c8711cdf10b02197b143fc1b78f0d6383d79a4be75a8dd5a464a95d138a1b8",
          "value": "Your unit is on the battlefield and \u0005unengaged\u0006."
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 3,
          "kind": "text",
          "sha256": "71b6143d5f310205f6d72379853a67a7f27f18983ba7f07ef42b7255d7fca1ee",
          "value": "\u000eBefore Moving"
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 4,
          "kind": "text",
          "sha256": "a63907a6feccf00dd8db11829c1405d9359defce68726ec69b0160eab6847289",
          "value": "Make an \u0005advance roll\u0006 by rolling one D6."
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 5,
          "kind": "text",
          "sha256": "ca90fa8987329bf4863a7c325b6d45c8f39a6e1c604776ff417fc8e16889655d",
          "value": "\u000eEffect"
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 6,
          "kind": "text",
          "sha256": "eeebc152a13fd04424a97836281189fec301c368951c216599430a84fc1bd1ab",
          "value": "Your unit moves as described in Moving (03)."
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 7,
          "kind": "text",
          "sha256": "93f7fc4c73f4450e9f798302b2574b0462ae4f1e7e6ad9d40f4c7e9d6026a315",
          "value": "\u000eAfter Moving"
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 8,
          "kind": "text",
          "sha256": "7ea44889c11182e5c1b5faa26f13f400d8ae6f5ea372a9efca05e54701bb363a",
          "value": "• Your unit must be \u0005unengaged\u0006."
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 9,
          "kind": "text",
          "sha256": "5bfe1020a7dcb4edcf0922df26cee7fec567379f3156d32da4235e481336b672",
          "value": "• Until the end of the turn, unless otherwise stated, your unit is \u0001not\u0002 \u0005eligible to declare a charge\u0006 or \u0005start an action\u0006."
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 10,
          "kind": "text",
          "sha256": "5b373b35b06069cf8f69cd7cdd16704f27a930c2ec5ddc52acffa212c01f32a4",
          "value": "\u000eMaximum Distance"
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 11,
          "kind": "text",
          "sha256": "57fd50e215e6570855d0062b08033907d6482aa19f45219298d0e93fa1c765de",
          "value": "Advance roll + your unit’s \u0005M\u0006 characteristic."
        }
      ],
